  "behavior": [
    "Reject unsigned bank>=1200 or occupied first row before opening files. Format native filename with lowWORD bank,open/read16-byte header and fail at actual fatal entry if magic differs.",
    "Build exact16-byte PCMWAVEFORMAT and20-byte historical DSBUFFERDESC with ordinary memset and observed fields. Use rate lowWORD,PCM8 flagBYTE13 and static/software threshold1000. No extended PCM capacity is invented.",
    "If device exists,CreateSoundBuffer writes the actual first bank pointer; only a nonnull resulting pointer permits initialization. Reload the current first buffer before each zero Position/Frequency/Pan/Volume call.",
    "Read floor(sample_bytes/4)compressed bytes at scratch_base+0xfffff-that_count. Lock current first buffer with live header byte width. Ignore HRESULT; decode/copy/unlock only if first block and byte count are nonzero.",
    "Run actual decoder from state0 into native scratch. Copy BYTE PCM as127-(sample>>8) or signed16 samples into first block; leave second lock block untouched but forward its pointer/count to Unlock. Odd lengths retain original floor/read behavior.",
    "Duplicate the live first buffer into lanes1..3. Only null output triggers realF710 cleanup; HRESULT alone does not. Bank824 cleanup exemption follows actual shared flag79e450. Finally clear the indexed counterWORD,store current metadataBYTE12 and close the original handle."
  ],
